<title>USA: Orangeburg Cty SD 8, S.C., won by Wachovia Bank.</title>
<headline>Orangeburg Cty SD 8, S.C., won by Wachovia Bank.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-05-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Wachovia Bank of North Carolina said it won $8.400 million of Orangeburg County School District No. 8, S.C., general obligation bonds, Series 1997, with a net interest cost of 5.41 percent.</p>
</text>
